# Line endings.
#
# core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default) checked these files out as CRLF while
# the committed blobs are LF. That broke two things:
#   * `scripts/*.sh` executed through their shebang read "bash\r";
#   * `node scripts/gen-presets.mjs --check` compares generated text byte-for-byte
#     and reported presets.patch.yml as stale although nothing had drifted.
# Keep source and generated artifacts LF in the worktree so a Windows checkout
# behaves like CI.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# Committed runtime for the `github:` install channel — never reflow.
packages/*/lib/*.js text eol=lf
